{"id":"4b8f9443a0ee72c6","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology.md","title":"Definition — Lawvere–Tierney Topology","display":"Definition — Lawvere–Tierney Topology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology","aliases":["14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology"],"display":"Definition — Lawvere–Tierney Topology","depends_on":["[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","[[14-df-morphism]]","[[14-df-classifier-meet-implication]]","[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Lawvere–Tierney Topology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" href=\"?note=a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" title=\"14-df-subobject-classifier\">14-df-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c5452002ba29fda\" href=\"?note=5c5452002ba29fda\" title=\"14-df-morphism\">14-df-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c10899c45464ad7f\" href=\"?note=c10899c45464ad7f\" title=\"14-df-classifier-meet-implication\">14-df-classifier-meet-implication</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1044b7940aaa4f1f\" href=\"?note=1044b7940aaa4f1f\" title=\"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products\">14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> (topos, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\Omega\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top:1\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\top:1\\to\\Omega\\)</span> (subobject classifier, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" href=\"?note=a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" title=\"14-df-subobject-classifier\">14-df-subobject-classifier</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\Omega)\">\\(j\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\Omega)\\)</span> (morphism, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5c5452002ba29fda\" href=\"?note=5c5452002ba29fda\" title=\"14-df-morphism\">14-df-morphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge:\\Omega\\times\\Omega\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\wedge:\\Omega\\times\\Omega\\to\\Omega\\)</span> (meet)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsLTTopology}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsLTTopology}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge\">\\(\\wedge\\)</span> 特指 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c10899c45464ad7f\" href=\"?note=c10899c45464ad7f\" title=\"14-df-classifier-meet-implication\">14-df-classifier-meet-implication</a> 定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_\\Omega\">\\(\\wedge_\\Omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\times j\">\\(j\\times j\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1044b7940aaa4f1f\" href=\"?note=1044b7940aaa4f1f\" title=\"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products\">14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products</a> 的积箭头，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 是选定终对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsLTTopology}(j)\\leftrightarrow j\\circ\\top=\\top\\land j\\circ j=j\\land j\\circ\\wedge=\\wedge\\circ(j\\times j)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsLTTopology}(j)\\leftrightarrow j\\circ\\top=\\top\\land j\\circ j=j\\land j\\circ\\wedge=\\wedge\\circ(j\\times j)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：V.1 Lawvere–Tierney Topologies，印刷页 219–222。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge\">\\(\\wedge\\)</span> 必须是分类子上的典范真值交运算，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"c10899c45464ad7f\" href=\"?note=c10899c45464ad7f\" title=\"14-df-classifier-meet-implication\">14-df-classifier-meet-implication</a>，而非任意同类型箭头。真值保持、幂等与交保持给出普遍闭包算子；不另加一般点集拓扑的开集族。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"5c5452002ba29fda","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-cl